[
{
"chunk": 0,
"text": "Day ten.",
"start": 0.0,
"end": 0.94
},
{
"chunk": 0,
"text": "The ground shakes.",
"start": 1.1,
"end": 2.238
},
{
"chunk": 0,
"text": "Dirt pours from the ceiling of your tunnel.",
"start": 2.47,
"end": 5.036
},
{
"chunk": 0,
"text": "Outside, the sky is on fire.",
"start": 5.698,
"end": 7.939
},
{
"chunk": 0,
"text": "And at the door, something too big to fit inside is breathing.",
"start": 8.298,
"end": 13.453
},
{
"chunk": 2,
"text": "Ten days ago, you were asleep in your own bed.",
"start": 15.403,
"end": 18.7
},
{
"chunk": 3,
"text": "You have 10 days before the asteroid that killed the dinosaurs.",
"start": 19.251,
"end": 22.85
},
{
"chunk": 3,
"text": "Every big animal you see will die.",
"start": 23.512,
"end": 25.938
},
{
"chunk": 3,
"text": "You won't.",
"start": 26.101,
"end": 26.867
},
{
"chunk": 3,
"text": "If you stay small.",
"start": 27.645,
"end": 28.818
},
{
"chunk": 4,
"text": "The night before was like any other.",
"start": 32.317,
"end": 34.511
},
{
"chunk": 4,
"text": "Homework, a documentary about the dinosaurs, your phone at 23%.",
"start": 34.987,
"end": 40.026
},
{
"chunk": 4,
"text": "\"I'll charge it in the morning.\"",
"start": 40.432,
"end": 41.965
},
{
"chunk": 4,
"text": "In your backpack, ready for school: two textbooks, a sandwich, two chocolate bars, half a bottle of water.",
"start": 42.325,
"end": 49.685
},
{
"chunk": 4,
"text": "And a library book you wanted to read in the break tomorrow.",
"start": 50.266,
"end": 53.133
},
{
"chunk": 4,
"text": "The Last Day of the Dinosaurs.",
"start": 53.551,
"end": 56.14
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "In the morning, there's no ceiling.",
"start": 56.691,
"end": 58.653
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "There are leaves, each one bigger than your bed.",
"start": 58.92,
"end": 61.846
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "The air is hot and wet.",
"start": 62.264,
"end": 63.866
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "No cars.",
"start": 63.982,
"end": 64.69
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "No voices.",
"start": 64.76,
"end": 65.712
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "Next to you, something rises from the ground like a tree trunk.",
"start": 66.374,
"end": 69.602
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "It isn't a tree.",
"start": 70.639,
"end": 71.754
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "It has claws.",
"start": 72.536,
"end": 73.662
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "The foot lifts, slams down one step ahead, and the ground jumps under you.",
"start": 73.976,
"end": 79.955
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "You don't breathe until the footsteps fade.",
"start": 80.443,
"end": 83.751
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "Your backpack is lying next to you.",
"start": 84.301,
"end": 86.391
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "Your phone is still in your pocket.",
"start": 86.704,
"end": 88.62
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "No signal.",
"start": 89.282,
"end": 90.164
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "No internet.",
"start": 90.327,
"end": 91.244
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "Just one message that wasn't there last night.",
"start": 91.36,
"end": 94.193
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "\"Impact: 10 days.",
"start": 94.854,
"end": 96.619
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "3,000 kilometers south.\"",
"start": 96.782,
"end": 98.628
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "A prank.",
"start": 98.788,
"end": 99.554
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "A dream.",
"start": 99.716,
"end": 100.494
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "It has to be.",
"start": 100.541,
"end": 101.528
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "You switch it off at 22%, and you start walking.",
"start": 102.108,
"end": 105.626
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "All afternoon, you look for a road, a wire, a plane in the sky.",
"start": 106.175,
"end": 110.54
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "Anything.",
"start": 110.703,
"end": 111.469
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "There's nothing.",
"start": 111.629,
"end": 112.535
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "In the evening, you find the owner of the foot.",
"start": 113.441,
"end": 115.855
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "A T.",
"start": 116.018,
"end": 116.447
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "rex.",
"start": 116.494,
"end": 117.063
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "12 meters, nose to tail, with a long pale scar across its snout.",
"start": 117.55,
"end": 122.368
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "For one second, its head turns toward you.",
"start": 123.03,
"end": 125.665
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "Then it walks on.",
"start": 125.898,
"end": 127.511
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "It's not a dream.",
"start": 128.967,
"end": 130.244
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "That night you squeeze in between the roots of a giant tree.",
"start": 130.795,
"end": 134.324
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "You're shaking.",
"start": 134.522,
"end": 135.474
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "You don't want to sleep.",
"start": 135.532,
"end": 136.739
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "In the dark, you open your backpack, looking for anything that makes sense.",
"start": 137.32,
"end": 142.033
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "The library book.",
"start": 142.521,
"end": 143.763
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "On the cover, a T.",
"start": 144.181,
"end": 145.772
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "rex skeleton in a museum.",
"start": 145.807,
"end": 147.745
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "You don't look closely.",
"start": 147.931,
"end": 149.417
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Inside, chapter seven.",
"start": 150.079,
"end": 151.925
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Who Survived.",
"start": 152.085,
"end": 153.107
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Animals that were small.",
"start": 153.687,
"end": 155.127
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Animals that hid underground.",
"start": 155.545,
"end": 157.251
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Animals that lived near fresh water.",
"start": 157.739,
"end": 159.991
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "On the back page, with your school pen, you write a plan.",
"start": 160.572,
"end": 163.845
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Three things.",
"start": 166.707,
"end": 167.52
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Ten days.",
"start": 167.68,
"end": 168.458
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "None of them done.",
"start": 168.771,
"end": 169.758
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "You don't decide to fall asleep.",
"start": 170.176,
"end": 171.86
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Your body decides for you.",
"start": 172.092,
"end": 174.542
},
{
"chunk": 9,
"text": "In the morning, there's a small hole by the roots.",
"start": 175.842,
"end": 178.628
},
{
"chunk": 9,
"text": "A furry face pokes out.",
"start": 178.791,
"end": 180.602
},
{
"chunk": 9,
"text": "Mouse-sized.",
"start": 181.264,
"end": 182.204
},
{
"chunk": 9,
"text": "Sniffs.",
"start": 182.344,
"end": 183.005
},
{
"chunk": 9,
"text": "Disappears.",
"start": 183.203,
"end": 184.097
},
{
"chunk": 9,
"text": "You name him Pip.",
"start": 184.758,
"end": 186.802
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "The T.",
"start": 187.352,
"end": 187.77
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "rex needs mountains of meat every day.",
"start": 187.828,
"end": 190.08
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "Pip needs a few seeds and a hole to hide in.",
"start": 190.568,
"end": 193.157
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "And your book agrees.",
"start": 193.819,
"end": 195.316
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "Scientists think that after the impact, almost no land animal heavier than about 25 kilograms survived.",
"start": 195.978,
"end": 203.048
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "You weigh 70.",
"start": 204.086,
"end": 205.642
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "So you'll have to think like Pip.",
"start": 205.909,
"end": 207.662
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "Rule one: stay small.",
"start": 208.242,
"end": 210.889
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "You eat half the sandwich.",
"start": 211.44,
"end": 213.065
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "You save the rest.",
"start": 213.123,
"end": 214.273
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "Then you watch what Pip eats.",
"start": 214.76,
"end": 216.804
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "Small red berries, seeds from one kind of fern.",
"start": 217.384,
"end": 220.519
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "That's no guarantee.",
"start": 220.937,
"end": 222.156
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "Plenty of things a mouse can eat would kill you.",
"start": 222.249,
"end": 224.466
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "But he's a mammal, like you, and the sandwich won't last.",
"start": 225.047,
"end": 228.449
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "You eat one berry.",
"start": 229.029,
"end": 230.167
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "You wait.",
"start": 230.213,
"end": 230.863
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "By evening, nothing has happened.",
"start": 231.281,
"end": 233.209
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "You fill your pockets.",
"start": 233.696,
"end": 235.449
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "Day three.",
"start": 236.299,
"end": 237.228
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "The bottle is empty.",
"start": 237.495,
"end": 238.667
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "Your throat is burning.",
"start": 238.737,
"end": 240.049
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "You follow the sound of water to a wide, muddy river.",
"start": 240.711,
"end": 244.321
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "At the edge, a log is floating.",
"start": 244.809,
"end": 246.864
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "It blinks.",
"start": 247.995,
"end": 248.83
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "It isn't a log.",
"start": 249.868,
"end": 250.913
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "It's a crocodile.",
"start": 250.971,
"end": 252.817
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "So you don't drink from the river.",
"start": 253.367,
"end": 255.108
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "A few steps back from the bank, in the sand, you dig a pit and wait.",
"start": 255.689,
"end": 260.159
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "Water seeps in through the sand.",
"start": 260.577,
"end": 262.585
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "Slow.",
"start": 263.166,
"end": 263.851
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "Muddy.",
"start": 264.011,
"end": 264.754
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "But cleaner than the river, and far from the teeth.",
"start": 265.172,
"end": 268.051
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "You fill the bottle.",
"start": 268.539,
"end": 269.735
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "In the shallow pools, small fish are trapped.",
"start": 270.153,
"end": 273.171
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "You catch three and dry them on a hot rock.",
"start": 273.659,
"end": 276.271
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "No fire needed.",
"start": 276.852,
"end": 278.082
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "It's warm here, almost tropical, even at night.",
"start": 278.663,
"end": 281.588
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "From now on, every morning starts at the pools.",
"start": 282.366,
"end": 285.107
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "The book says freshwater animals, turtles, frogs, even crocodiles, made it through far better than most.",
"start": 287.469,
"end": 293.657
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "Rule two: stay near water.",
"start": 294.238,
"end": 297.21
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "Day four.",
"start": 298.51,
"end": 299.416
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "The ground shakes again.",
"start": 300.077,
"end": 301.494
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "Not one footstep.",
"start": 301.587,
"end": 302.829
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "Hundreds.",
"start": 302.991,
"end": 303.653
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "A herd of duck-billed dinosaurs comes along the river.",
"start": 304.013,
"end": 307.589
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "Then a deep sound rolls in from far away.",
"start": 308.355,
"end": 311.026
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "You feel it in your chest more than your ears.",
"start": 311.513,
"end": 314.183
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "The herd panics.",
"start": 314.764,
"end": 316.146
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "Trees snap.",
"start": 316.285,
"end": 317.353
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "You throw yourself behind a fallen log.",
"start": 317.713,
"end": 320.07
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "When the dust settles, one of them didn't get up.",
"start": 320.732,
"end": 322.995
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "And it has something you need.",
"start": 323.413,
"end": 324.865
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "A shoulder blade.",
"start": 324.923,
"end": 325.851
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "Flat.",
"start": 325.91,
"end": 326.362
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "Wide.",
"start": 326.432,
"end": 327.012
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "The size of a paddle.",
"start": 327.129,
"end": 328.359
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "From today, your shovel is a dinosaur.",
"start": 329.137,
"end": 331.947
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "Day five.",
"start": 332.796,
"end": 333.713
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "You read the page you've been avoiding.",
"start": 334.375,
"end": 336.198
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "Within an hour of the impact, burning debris falls back through the sky, all over the world.",
"start": 336.616,
"end": 342.885
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "Scientists still argue about how hot it got.",
"start": 343.466,
"end": 346.658
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "In many places, hot enough to set forests on fire.",
"start": 347.076,
"end": 350.362
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "On the surface, there's nowhere to hide.",
"start": 350.942,
"end": 353.113
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "Under a meter of soil, maybe.",
"start": 353.891,
"end": 355.691
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "Rule three: stay underground.",
"start": 356.469,
"end": 359.685
},
{
"chunk": 16,
"text": "You find a clay bank above the river and start digging.",
"start": 360.235,
"end": 363.857
},
{
"chunk": 17,
"text": "Now the math.",
"start": 364.407,
"end": 365.614
},
{
"chunk": 17,
"text": "With a bone, in clay, a cave big enough to crouch in grows about 30 centimeters a day.",
"start": 366.276,
"end": 372.72
},
{
"chunk": 17,
"text": "To get a meter of soil over your head, you have to go two and a half meters in.",
"start": 373.138,
"end": 377.445
},
{
"chunk": 17,
"text": "That's eight days of work.",
"start": 377.933,
"end": 379.628
},
{
"chunk": 17,
"text": "The asteroid hits on day ten.",
"start": 380.29,
"end": 382.217
},
{
"chunk": 17,
"text": "You have five.",
"start": 382.798,
"end": 384.051
},
{
"chunk": 18,
"text": "You dig until it's too dark to see, then sleep in the mud by the hole.",
"start": 384.601,
"end": 390.452
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "Day six.",
"start": 391.303,
"end": 392.174
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "Your hands are blistered.",
"start": 392.441,
"end": 393.857
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "You're in as deep as your arms can reach.",
"start": 394.275,
"end": 396.458
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "Then the roof comes down on you.",
"start": 397.495,
"end": 399.701
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "You crawl out coughing dirt.",
"start": 400.119,
"end": 402.081
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "Everything you dug, gone.",
"start": 403.212,
"end": 404.988
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "Four days left.",
"start": 405.22,
"end": 406.393
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "Eight days of digging.",
"start": 406.881,
"end": 408.332
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "You sit in the mud.",
"start": 408.882,
"end": 410.008
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "And there, in the bank next to your ruin, a tiny new hole.",
"start": 410.229,
"end": 414.501
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "Pip followed you to the river.",
"start": 415.69,
"end": 417.454
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "His hole is tiny.",
"start": 417.64,
"end": 419.196
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "And it doesn't collapse.",
"start": 419.765,
"end": 420.984
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "Because Pip doesn't dig a cave.",
"start": 421.553,
"end": 423.341
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "Pip digs a tunnel exactly as wide as Pip, and one small nest at the end.",
"start": 424.212,
"end": 429.285
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "So you stop digging a cave.",
"start": 429.703,
"end": 431.689
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "You dig a tunnel exactly as wide as your shoulders.",
"start": 432.35,
"end": 435.171
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "A quarter of the dirt.",
"start": 435.589,
"end": 437.11
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "Four times as fast.",
"start": 437.25,
"end": 438.713
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "And you shape the roof into an arch, because an arch pushes the weight into the walls instead of down on you.",
"start": 439.2,
"end": 445.888
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "The entrance faces north, away from where the asteroid will hit.",
"start": 446.793,
"end": 451.46
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "Maybe it makes no difference.",
"start": 452.366,
"end": 453.806
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "It feels right.",
"start": 453.84,
"end": 454.874
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "Stay small.",
"start": 455.034,
"end": 455.917
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "Even when you dig.",
"start": 456.079,
"end": 458.065
},
{
"chunk": 21,
"text": "By dark, the tunnel swallows you to the waist.",
"start": 460.814,
"end": 463.531
},
{
"chunk": 21,
"text": "That night you sleep with your head underground and your boots outside.",
"start": 464.193,
"end": 467.792
},
{
"chunk": 21,
"text": "It's a start.",
"start": 467.954,
"end": 469.405
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "Day seven.",
"start": 470.706,
"end": 471.588
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "Pip doesn't run anymore.",
"start": 472.494,
"end": 474.026
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "He's waiting at the entrance in the morning.",
"start": 474.293,
"end": 476.279
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "You split your last chocolate with him, and you dig.",
"start": 476.697,
"end": 479.739
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "By noon, the blisters have burst.",
"start": 482.357,
"end": 484.667
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "Your palms are raw and bleeding into the clay.",
"start": 485.085,
"end": 487.952
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "And you know a hand that breaks today digs nothing tomorrow.",
"start": 488.37,
"end": 491.366
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "So you stop.",
"start": 491.783,
"end": 492.643
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "Even with three days left.",
"start": 493.223,
"end": 494.64
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "Even if the end is coming anyway.",
"start": 495.301,
"end": 497.229
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "For one afternoon, you rest.",
"start": 497.321,
"end": 499.934
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "You switch the phone on.",
"start": 500.484,
"end": 501.703
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Just for a minute.",
"start": 501.796,
"end": 502.69
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "The minute becomes an hour.",
"start": 502.957,
"end": 504.431
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Photos.",
"start": 504.629,
"end": 505.291
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Your room.",
"start": 505.451,
"end": 506.229
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Your mom in the kitchen.",
"start": 506.542,
"end": 507.785
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Your friends outside school.",
"start": 507.901,
"end": 509.851
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Then a video, from a few months ago.",
"start": 510.432,
"end": 512.568
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "A class trip to a museum.",
"start": 512.603,
"end": 514.24
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "You, laughing at the camera, a giant skeleton behind you.",
"start": 514.728,
"end": 518.861
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "\"If they ever sent me back to the dinosaurs?",
"start": 519.349,
"end": 522.03
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "I'd survive.",
"start": 522.228,
"end": 523.238
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Easy.\"",
"start": 523.398,
"end": 524.211
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Your friends laughing behind the phone.",
"start": 524.989,
"end": 528.03
},
{
"chunk": 25,
"text": "Why are you here?",
"start": 529.98,
"end": 531.095
},
{
"chunk": 25,
"text": "What happened?",
"start": 531.129,
"end": 532.256
},
{
"chunk": 25,
"text": "Maybe you're still asleep.",
"start": 532.569,
"end": 533.997
},
{
"chunk": 25,
"text": "Maybe this is all a dream.",
"start": 534.64,
"end": 536.405
},
{
"chunk": 25,
"text": "You look down at your hands.",
"start": 536.892,
"end": 538.645
},
{
"chunk": 25,
"text": "The pain is real.",
"start": 539.776,
"end": 541.018
},
{
"chunk": 25,
"text": "It's not a dream.",
"start": 541.603,
"end": 542.868
},
{
"chunk": 27,
"text": "You always said you'd survive.",
"start": 544.818,
"end": 546.768
},
{
"chunk": 27,
"text": "Now you have to prove it.",
"start": 547.899,
"end": 549.095
},
{
"chunk": 27,
"text": "When you switch it off, it's at 11%.",
"start": 549.873,
"end": 552.137
},
{
"chunk": 27,
"text": "Ten percent, gone on home.",
"start": 552.206,
"end": 554.087
},
{
"chunk": 27,
"text": "It was worth it.",
"start": 554.753,
"end": 556.413
},
{
"chunk": 28,
"text": "That night, you fit all the way inside.",
"start": 556.963,
"end": 559.564
},
{
"chunk": 28,
"text": "You wake up, and Pip is asleep in your jacket pocket.",
"start": 560.214,
"end": 563.418
},
{
"chunk": 28,
"text": "Warm.",
"start": 564.312,
"end": 565.009
},
{
"chunk": 28,
"text": "Breathing.",
"start": 565.169,
"end": 565.866
},
{
"chunk": 28,
"text": "Seven days in a world with no one.",
"start": 566.504,
"end": 569.105
},
{
"chunk": 28,
"text": "And now you have someone.",
"start": 570.41,
"end": 572.917
},
{
"chunk": 29,
"text": "Day eight.",
"start": 574.218,
"end": 574.903
},
{
"chunk": 29,
"text": "You dig until your arms shake.",
"start": 574.996,
"end": 576.993
},
{
"chunk": 29,
"text": "Two and a half meters.",
"start": 577.48,
"end": 578.758
},
{
"chunk": 29,
"text": "And at the very end, a nest, just big enough to sit up in.",
"start": 579.117,
"end": 583.053
},
{
"chunk": 29,
"text": "A meter of soil over your head.",
"start": 585.671,
"end": 587.564
},
{
"chunk": 29,
"text": "That night, for the first time in eight days, nothing can step on you.",
"start": 588.225,
"end": 593.368
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "At midnight, you wake.",
"start": 595.318,
"end": 596.723
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Scratching at the entrance.",
"start": 597.141,
"end": 598.627
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Then sniffing.",
"start": 598.743,
"end": 599.823
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Then something coming in.",
"start": 600.241,
"end": 601.843
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "In the dark, two yellow eyes.",
"start": 602.505,
"end": 604.629
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "A feathered hunter.",
"start": 604.745,
"end": 605.837
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Fast.",
"start": 606.034,
"end": 606.719
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Only as tall as your knee.",
"start": 606.8,
"end": 608.379
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Not a T.",
"start": 608.867,
"end": 609.413
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "rex.",
"start": 609.471,
"end": 609.959
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Small enough to fit in your tunnel.",
"start": 610.04,
"end": 611.723
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Small doesn't mean safe.",
"start": 612.385,
"end": 614.127
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "Your headlamp lights it up.",
"start": 614.677,
"end": 616.198
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "It doesn't care.",
"start": 616.314,
"end": 617.382
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "It lunges.",
"start": 618.048,
"end": 618.989
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "Claws rip across your right forearm.",
"start": 619.349,
"end": 621.729
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "No knife.",
"start": 622.309,
"end": 622.971
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "No fire.",
"start": 623.133,
"end": 623.923
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "No room to swing a bone.",
"start": 624.039,
"end": 625.502
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "Just one thing this world has never seen.",
"start": 626.539,
"end": 628.885
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "You switch the phone on.",
"start": 629.465,
"end": 630.684
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "11%.",
"start": 630.707,
"end": 631.636
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "You hit the alarm and point the flashlight straight into its face.",
"start": 631.694,
"end": 635.165
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "A sound sixty-six million years too early fills the tunnel.",
"start": 635.827,
"end": 640.03
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "It shrieks, and it's gone.",
"start": 640.998,
"end": 642.89
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "But it could come back.",
"start": 643.44,
"end": 645.089
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "Blood drips from your arm.",
"start": 645.994,
"end": 647.712
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "Pip creeps out of your pocket and sits by your hand.",
"start": 648.13,
"end": 651.091
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "You can't leave the light on.",
"start": 651.579,
"end": 653.03
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "It would be dead in an hour, and dawn is five hours away.",
"start": 653.146,
"end": 656.872
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "So you count.",
"start": 657.035,
"end": 658.231
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "Ten seconds of light.",
"start": 659.009,
"end": 660.437
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "One minute of dark.",
"start": 660.855,
"end": 662.062
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "Every time the dark comes back, you listen for claws.",
"start": 662.724,
"end": 666.892
},
{
"chunk": 35,
"text": "When the sky turns grey, you switch it off.",
"start": 668.842,
"end": 671.257
},
{
"chunk": 35,
"text": "3%.",
"start": 672.585,
"end": 673.479
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Day nine.",
"start": 674.329,
"end": 675.177
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "You have a fever.",
"start": 675.269,
"end": 676.256
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "The wound is hot.",
"start": 676.372,
"end": 677.475
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "You wrap it in a strip torn from your t-shirt.",
"start": 677.893,
"end": 680.564
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "The entrance let a hunter in.",
"start": 681.144,
"end": 683.002
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Tomorrow, it has to keep the whole world out.",
"start": 683.42,
"end": 686.125
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "One-handed, you drag stones up from the river and stack them around the opening.",
"start": 686.786,
"end": 691.152
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Last, a big flat stone.",
"start": 691.639,
"end": 693.52
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "From inside, you can drag it across like a door, and push it aside to get out.",
"start": 694.298,
"end": 698.802
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "When it's closed, it leaves a gap a hand wide.",
"start": 699.708,
"end": 702.75
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Enough for air.",
"start": 703.412,
"end": 704.456
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Not enough for teeth.",
"start": 704.515,
"end": 705.745
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "The sun is going down when the door slides into place.",
"start": 706.407,
"end": 709.484
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Just in time.",
"start": 712.171,
"end": 713.17
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Two out of three.",
"start": 713.402,
"end": 714.458
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Twelve dried fish won't last a winter.",
"start": 714.946,
"end": 717.338
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "And you're out of days.",
"start": 717.431,
"end": 719.671
},
{
"chunk": 37,
"text": "You switch the phone on one more time.",
"start": 720.972,
"end": 723.41
},
{
"chunk": 37,
"text": "The message has changed.",
"start": 723.724,
"end": 725.198
},
{
"chunk": 37,
"text": "\"Impact: tomorrow.\"",
"start": 725.86,
"end": 727.532
},
{
"chunk": 37,
"text": "You switch it off.",
"start": 727.95,
"end": 729.656
},
{
"chunk": 38,
"text": "That night you slide the door aside and climb out.",
"start": 730.206,
"end": 733.05
},
{
"chunk": 38,
"text": "The sky is full of stars.",
"start": 733.41,
"end": 735.222
},
{
"chunk": 38,
"text": "From across the river comes that low, familiar call.",
"start": 735.802,
"end": 739.122
},
{
"chunk": 38,
"text": "The same T.",
"start": 739.61,
"end": 740.667
},
{
"chunk": 38,
"text": "rex.",
"start": 740.713,
"end": 741.363
},
{
"chunk": 38,
"text": "The last night of the dinosaurs.",
"start": 741.677,
"end": 743.534
},
{
"chunk": 38,
"text": "And only you know.",
"start": 743.883,
"end": 746.135
},
{
"chunk": 39,
"text": "It isn't a strange morning.",
"start": 746.685,
"end": 748.38
},
{
"chunk": 39,
"text": "That's what makes it strange.",
"start": 748.961,
"end": 750.632
},
{
"chunk": 39,
"text": "Birds are singing.",
"start": 750.992,
"end": 752.165
},
{
"chunk": 39,
"text": "Insects are buzzing.",
"start": 752.325,
"end": 753.753
},
{
"chunk": 39,
"text": "A few triceratops are drinking across the river.",
"start": 754.333,
"end": 757.294
},
{
"chunk": 39,
"text": "None of them know.",
"start": 758.072,
"end": 759.906
},
{
"chunk": 40,
"text": "Then, in the south, a light.",
"start": 760.456,
"end": 762.871
},
{
"chunk": 40,
"text": "Not like the sun.",
"start": 763.533,
"end": 764.531
},
{
"chunk": 40,
"text": "Like someone switched the sky on by mistake.",
"start": 765.662,
"end": 769.133
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "Your book said the shaking comes within minutes.",
"start": 769.683,
"end": 772.539
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "It's right.",
"start": 773.67,
"end": 774.389
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "The ground starts to move.",
"start": 775.295,
"end": 776.955
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "Not like a footstep.",
"start": 777.373,
"end": 778.662
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "Like the whole world.",
"start": 778.778,
"end": 779.939
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "The river pulls back.",
"start": 780.171,
"end": 781.68
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "Then it comes back, the wrong way.",
"start": 781.797,
"end": 784.398
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "A wall of water runs upstream and throws fish onto the bank.",
"start": 784.816,
"end": 788.519
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "It climbs up the bank, and stops a hand below your door.",
"start": 789.007,
"end": 792.78
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "When it pulls back, you run down and grab every fish you can carry.",
"start": 793.268,
"end": 797.331
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "Food for the dark.",
"start": 798.369,
"end": 799.46
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "The last thing on your list.",
"start": 801.73,
"end": 803.575
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "The end of the world just handed it to you.",
"start": 804.237,
"end": 806.594
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "This isn't imagination.",
"start": 807.082,
"end": 808.916
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "In North Dakota, scientists found fossil fish with tiny glass beads from this impact stuck in their gills.",
"start": 809.404,
"end": 817.426
},
{
"chunk": 42,
"text": "Then those same glass beads start falling from the sky.",
"start": 817.976,
"end": 821.436
},
{
"chunk": 42,
"text": "Small and hot, like burning hail.",
"start": 822.341,
"end": 825.151
},
{
"chunk": 42,
"text": "The sky turns red.",
"start": 825.383,
"end": 826.927
},
{
"chunk": 42,
"text": "You drag the door shut, hold Pip tight and crawl to the end of the tunnel.",
"start": 827.508,
"end": 831.792
},
{
"chunk": 42,
"text": "Outside, the first trees catch fire.",
"start": 832.373,
"end": 835.391
},
{
"chunk": 42,
"text": "By evening, the whole forest is burning.",
"start": 835.972,
"end": 838.874
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "And then, outside, footsteps.",
"start": 839.424,
"end": 841.897
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "Heavy.",
"start": 842.454,
"end": 843.081
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "Slow.",
"start": 843.267,
"end": 843.998
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "Close.",
"start": 844.158,
"end": 844.773
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "Something huge collapses at your door, and its shadow covers the gap.",
"start": 845.528,
"end": 849.615
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "The T.",
"start": 850.172,
"end": 850.602
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "rex.",
"start": 850.66,
"end": 851.194
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "From day one.",
"start": 851.354,
"end": 852.295
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "The scar across its snout.",
"start": 852.388,
"end": 854.048
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "Its huge snout is right against the stones.",
"start": 854.687,
"end": 857.229
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "Its hot breath fills your tunnel.",
"start": 857.345,
"end": 859.493
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "It can't get in.",
"start": 860.403,
"end": 861.413
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "It doesn't even try.",
"start": 861.68,
"end": 862.818
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "It only came for the cool soil at your door, away from the fire.",
"start": 862.957,
"end": 867.601
},
{
"chunk": 44,
"text": "All night, from the other side of the stones, you hear it breathing.",
"start": 868.151,
"end": 872.191
},
{
"chunk": 44,
"text": "Each breath slower.",
"start": 872.853,
"end": 875.303
},
{
"chunk": 46,
"text": "Until morning.",
"start": 877.253,
"end": 878.878
},
{
"chunk": 48,
"text": "Then it stops.",
"start": 880.828,
"end": 882.035
},
{
"chunk": 48,
"text": "The last dinosaur you saw died at your door.",
"start": 883.166,
"end": 886.765
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "In the days after, the river rises again and buries the T.",
"start": 888.065,
"end": 892.036
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "rex in thick mud.",
"start": 892.07,
"end": 893.522
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "Buried fast in mud.",
"start": 893.94,
"end": 895.635
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "That's how bones become fossils.",
"start": 896.122,
"end": 898.096
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "You open your book to the cover.",
"start": 898.514,
"end": 900.128
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "The museum skeleton.",
"start": 900.267,
"end": 901.672
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "And this time, you look closely.",
"start": 901.835,
"end": 903.773
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "A long scar, healed into the bone of the snout.",
"start": 904.985,
"end": 909.281
},
{
"chunk": 51,
"text": "The same skeleton that stood behind you in that video.",
"start": 911.231,
"end": 914.354
},
{
"chunk": 51,
"text": "The one you joked in front of.",
"start": 914.621,
"end": 916.281
},
{
"chunk": 51,
"text": "Sixty-six million years from now, it will stand in a museum.",
"start": 916.862,
"end": 920.507
},
{
"chunk": 51,
"text": "And one day, you'll stand in front of it, laughing, with no idea you were here when it died.",
"start": 920.995,
"end": 927.206
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Then the dark comes.",
"start": 927.756,
"end": 929.439
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Soot from fires all over the world, and dust from the impact, cover the whole sky.",
"start": 929.927,
"end": 935.79
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Sunlight can't get through.",
"start": 936.208,
"end": 937.717
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Plants can't grow.",
"start": 937.95,
"end": 939.447
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "And it gets cold.",
"start": 939.865,
"end": 940.991
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Scientists think this impact winter lasted months.",
"start": 941.897,
"end": 944.904
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Maybe years.",
"start": 945.217,
"end": 946.146
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "The world gave you one gift on its last day.",
"start": 946.622,
"end": 949.478
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Fire.",
"start": 950.058,
"end": 950.697
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "You carried an ember in from the burning forest.",
"start": 951.01,
"end": 953.402
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "You keep a small fire right at the gap, never deep inside.",
"start": 953.89,
"end": 957.791
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "In a closed tunnel, smoke kills quietly.",
"start": 958.267,
"end": 961.715
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "And at night, Pip sleeps against your neck.",
"start": 962.284,
"end": 965.012
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Two small bodies, keeping each other warm.",
"start": 965.5,
"end": 968.623
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "The phone won't turn on anymore.",
"start": 969.173,
"end": 971.065
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "The pen is dry.",
"start": 971.147,
"end": 972.18
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "So you scratch lines on the tunnel wall with a sharp stone.",
"start": 972.389,
"end": 975.35
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Inventory.",
"start": 975.721,
"end": 976.627
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Days after the end: 40.",
"start": 976.87,
"end": 978.624
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Still dark.",
"start": 979.158,
"end": 979.889
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Dried fish: 7.",
"start": 980.049,
"end": 981.826
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Running low.",
"start": 981.986,
"end": 982.729
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Dinosaurs left: zero.",
"start": 983.802,
"end": 985.694
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Friends: one.",
"start": 985.854,
"end": 987.236
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Mouse-sized.",
"start": 987.396,
"end": 988.998
},
{
"chunk": 54,
"text": "You repeat the rules to yourself.",
"start": 989.548,
"end": 991.475
},
{
"chunk": 54,
"text": "Stay small.",
"start": 992.137,
"end": 993.17
},
{
"chunk": 54,
"text": "Stay near water.",
"start": 993.33,
"end": 994.456
},
{
"chunk": 54,
"text": "Stay underground.",
"start": 994.616,
"end": 995.789
},
{
"chunk": 54,
"text": "And a new one, that no book ever taught you.",
"start": 996.566,
"end": 999.306
},
{
"chunk": 54,
"text": "Stay small…",
"start": 1000.212,
"end": 1001.21
},
{
"chunk": 54,
"text": "but don't stay alone.",
"start": 1001.443,
"end": 1003.602
},
{
"chunk": 55,
"text": "Small animals like Pip made it out of this darkness.",
"start": 1004.152,
"end": 1007.298
},
{
"chunk": 55,
"text": "Millions of years later, from small mammals like him, came horses, whales, apes.",
"start": 1007.786,
"end": 1014.229
},
{
"chunk": 55,
"text": "And people.",
"start": 1014.392,
"end": 1015.379
},
{
"chunk": 55,
"text": "Sixty-six million years later, one of Pip's great-great-great-grandchildren is watching this video.",
"start": 1015.739,
"end": 1022.078
},
{
"chunk": 56,
"text": "And just then, from outside the tunnel, a sound.",
"start": 1022.628,
"end": 1025.647
},
{
"chunk": 56,
"text": "A bird, singing.",
"start": 1026.777,
"end": 1028.17
},
{
"chunk": 56,
"text": "You cross out a line on the wall, and write it again.",
"start": 1028.53,
"end": 1031.154
},
{
"chunk": 56,
"text": "Dinosaurs left: zero…",
"start": 1032.482,
"end": 1034.699
},
{
"chunk": 56,
"text": "except the birds.",
"start": 1034.862,
"end": 1036.638
},
{
"chunk": 57,
"text": "On day one, what would you have done first?",
"start": 1037.189,
"end": 1040.208
},
{
"chunk": 57,
"text": "Tell me in the comments.",
"start": 1040.985,
"end": 1042.379
},
{
"chunk": 57,
"text": "And if you want to know what you and Pip did after the dark, tell me that too.",
"start": 1042.959,
"end": 1047.638
},
{
"chunk": 58,
"text": "Stay small.",
"start": 1048.188,
"end": 1048.989
},
{
"chunk": 58,
"text": "Stay alive.",
"start": 1049.047,
"end": 1050.138
}
]